    "text": "<p>Let, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi>AP</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi>AP</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>(</mo><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mo>)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>|</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mo>|</mo><mo>|</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mo>|</mo></math></p><p>We know that, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mfenced></mfrac></math>.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒<